WEBVTT

00:03:29.636 --> 00:03:32.516
because you're afraid to be judged.

00:03:32.556 --> 00:03:36.516
I think the first part of the solution
comes from within.

00:03:36.556 --> 00:03:39.196
It starts with self-awareness.

00:03:39.196 --> 00:03:40.556
When we feel pressured

00:03:40.596 --> 00:03:43.676
by a certain expectation
imposed by others,

00:03:43.716 --> 00:03:47.236
it usually indicates
that that same expectation

00:03:47.236 --> 00:03:49.756
is also coming from within us.

00:03:49.796 --> 00:03:52.436
I was disappointed in myself and sad

00:03:52.436 --> 00:03:55.676
that I couldn't live up
to my own expectations.

00:03:55.716 --> 00:03:59.876
I realized that I expected myself
to be an excellent role model

00:03:59.916 --> 00:04:02.396
who could prove
that everything is possible,